  m_text: '<b>CONQUEST: FRONTLINE COMMAND</b>

    An original multiplayer tactical shooter inspired by classic conquest mechanics.


    <b>Gameplay Architecture:</b> Senior Unity 6 Multiplayer Engineer

    <b>Networking Framework:</b> Unity Netcode for GameObjects (NGO) & Unity Transport

    <b>AI Infantry System:</b> Unity AI Navigation NavMesh Surface & Agents

    <b>Audio Architecture:</b> Unity DefaultMixer with Dynamic Rate-Limiter

    <b>User Interface:</b> 100% Unity Canvas and Text Mesh Pro

    <b>Assets:</b> Free, CC0, and Project Built-In Assets


    Server-authoritative game rules and combat checks, client-driven movement, and scalable bot infantry.'
